-msgid ""
-"<p>Open Settings → Import → <b>Lotus Organizer (.or6 / .csv) …</b> and "
-"select an OR6 file or CSV export. OR6 imports basic appointments, tasks, "
-"contacts and note text. Series, groups and other sections are skipped; "
-"layout, attachments, categories and alarms are not transferred. Read the "
-"import report. For CSV, export each desired section in Lotus using File → "
-"Export → Delimited ASCII/CSV, then import each file separately. The original "
-"is read only. The file limit is 32 MiB; ZIP imports also have entry and size "
-"limits.</p>"
-msgstr ""
-"<p>Wočińće nastajenja → import → <b>Lotus Organizer (.or6 / .csv) …</b> a "
-"wubjerće OR6- abo CSV-dataju. OR6 normalne terminy, nadawki, kontakty a "
-"tekst noticow přewozmje. Wospjetowanja, skupiny a druhe wotrězki so "
-"wuwostajeja; wuhotowanje, přiwěški, kategorije a dopomnjenki so njepřenjesu. "
-"Rozprawu wo imporće přepruwujće. Za CSV eksportujće kóždy wotrězk w Lotus "
-"přez Dataja → Eksport → Dźěleny ASCII/CSV a importujće dataje jednotliwje. "
-"Original so jenož čita. Mjeza: 32 MiB; za ZIP płaća dalše mjezy za zapiski a "
-"wulkosć.</p>"
