 #, no-javascript-format
 msgid ""
 "<p>Open a note or task and tap Print to use its current draft. Android "
@@ -7170,48 +6993,55 @@ msgstr ""
 #, no-javascript-format
 msgid ""
 "<p>Open the <span class='knopfwort'>Import</span> tab. Android keeps every "
-"app's private database closed to other apps, so Magnolie Notes cannot simply "
-"look inside Samsung Notes, Google Keep or another notepad. Use an export "
+"app's private database closed to other apps, so Magnolie Notes cannot simply"
+" look inside Samsung Notes, Google Keep or another notepad. Use an export "
 "file, an export folder, or Android's Share command instead.</p><h3>Choose "
 "one file</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Tap <span class='knopfwort'>Choose "
-"file …</span>.</li><li>Select the export in Android's document picker.</"
-"li><li>Wait while <span class='knopfwort'>Reading …</span> is displayed.</"
-"li><li>Read the result before opening Notes.</li></ol><p>The picker "
-"initially allows every file type because Magnolie Notes examines the name "
-"and contents itself. A selected file may contain at most <b>64 MiB</b>. An "
-"unknown file can fall back to a plain-text note, so do not select a binary "
-"file merely because Android offers it.</p><h3>Choose a folder</h3><p><span "
-"class='knopfwort'>Choose folder …</span> reads suitable files in that folder "
-"and its subfolders. Text, Markdown, JSON, HTML, ENEX and supported ZIP-based "
-"exports are considered; unrelated suffixes and files over 64 MiB are "
-"skipped. Magnolie reads the selection immediately and does not remember "
-"access to the folder for later.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A complete "
-"desktop archive does not fit here</b>A <b>.magnolie</b> complete archive "
-"from Magnolie Organizer is deliberately rejected with <i>Complete archive "
-"import is not yet supported on this device.</i> Keep that archive for the "
-"desktop Organizer.</div>"
+"file …</span>.</li><li>Select the export in Android's document "
+"picker.</li><li>Wait while <span class='knopfwort'>Reading …</span> is "
+"displayed.</li><li>Read the result before opening Notes.</li></ol><p>The "
+"file picker offers supported note exports. Magnolie Notes also checks the "
+"actual contents and rejects binary data or invalid UTF-8 text. A selected "
+"file is limited to <b>64 MiB</b>; a text file outside an archive is limited "
+"to <b>8 MiB</b>.</p><h3>Choose a folder</h3><p><span "
+"class='knopfwort'>Choose folder …</span> reads supported files in the "
+"selected folder and its subfolders. Unrelated file suffixes are ignored. One"
+" import is limited to <b>5,000 examined files and subfolders</b>, <b>5,000 "
+"notes</b>, <b>six subfolder levels</b>, <b>64 MiB of input files</b> and "
+"<b>64 MiB of decoded note content</b> altogether. If a supported file cannot"
+" be read completely or a limit is exceeded, the whole folder import stops "
+"without saving new notes. Split the export into smaller selections and try "
+"again. Folder access is not retained for later.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A"
+" complete desktop archive does not fit here</b>A <b>.magnolie</b> complete "
+"archive from Magnolie Organizer is deliberately rejected with <i>Complete "
+"archive import is not yet supported on this device.</i> Keep that archive "
+"for the desktop Organizer.</div>"
 msgstr ""
 "<p>Wočińće rajtark <span class='knopfwort'>Import</span>. Android priwatnu "
 "datowu banku kóždeho nałoženja před druhimi začinja, tuž Magnolie Notes "
 "njemóže prosće do Samsung Notes, Google Keep abo druheho notnika pohladać. "
-"Wužijće eksportowu dataju, eksportowy rjadowak abo Androidowy přikaz Dźělić."
-"</p><h3>Jednu dataju wubrać</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Podótkńće so <span "
-"class='knopfwort'>Dataju wubrać …</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće eksport w "
+"Wužijće eksportowu dataju, eksportowy rjadowak abo Androidowy přikaz "
+"Dźělić.</p><h3>Jednu dataju wubrać</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Podótkńće so"
+" <span class='knopfwort'>Dataju wubrać …</span>.</li><li>Wubjerće eksport w "
 "Androidowym dokumentowym wuběraku.</li><li>Čakajće, doniž so <span "
 "class='knopfwort'>Čita so …</span> pokazuje.</li><li>Čitajće wuslědk před "
-"wočinjenjom Noticow.</li></ol><p>Wuběrak spočatnje wšitke datajowe typy "
-"dowoli, dokelž Magnolie Notes mjeno a wobsah sama přepruwuje. Wubrana dataja "
-"smě maksimalnje <b>64 MiB</b> měć. Njeznata dataja móže jako lutna tekstowa "
-"notica skónčić, tuž binarnu dataju njewubjerće jenož dokelž ju Android "
-"poskića.</p><h3>Rjadowak wubrać</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Rjadowak "
-"wubrać …</span> přihódne dataje w tutym rjadowaku a jeho podrjadowakach "
-"čita. Tekst, Markdown, JSON, HTML, ENEX a podpěrane ZIP-eksporty so "
-"wobkedźbuja; cuze kóncowki a dataje nad 64 MiB so přeskoča. Magnolie wuběr "
-"hnydom čita a přistup k rjadowakej na pozdźišo njewobchowa.</p><div "
-"class='achtung'><b>Dospołny desktopowy archiw sem njepasuje</b>Dospołny "
-"archiw <b>.magnolie</b> z Magnolie Organizera so z <i>Import dospołneho "
-"archiwa na tutym graće hišće podpěrany njeje.</i> wotpokaza. Wobchowajće "
-"tutón archiw za desktopowy Organizer.</div>"
+"wočinjenjom Noticow.</li></ol><p>Wuběrak datajow poskića podpěrane eksporty "
+"noticow. Magnolie Notes kontroluje tež woprawdźity wobsah a wotpokazuje "
+"binarne daty abo njepłaćiwy tekst UTF-8. Wubrana dataja smě najwyše <b>64 "
+"MiB</b> wulka być; tekstowa dataja zwonka archiwa najwyše <b>8 "
+"MiB</b>.</p><h3>Rjadowak wubrać</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Rjadowak "
+"wubrać …</span> čita podpěrane dataje we wubranym rjadowaku a jeho "
+"podrjadowakach. Druhe datajowe kóncowki so přeskakuja. Za jedyn import płaća"
+" dohromady mjezy <b>5.000 přepruwowanych datajow a podrjadowakow</b>, "
+"<b>5.000 noticow</b>, <b>šěsć runin podrjadowakow</b>, <b>64 MiB začitanych "
+"datajow</b> a <b>64 MiB dekodowaneho wobsaha noticow</b>. Jeli so podpěrana "
+"dataja njeda dospołnje čitać abo so mjeza překroči, so cyły import rjadowaka"
+" přetorhnje, bjeztoho zo so nowe noticy składuja. Rozdźělće eksport do "
+"mjeńšich wuběrkow a spytajće hišće raz. Přistup k rjadowakej so za pozdźišo "
+"njeskładuje.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Dospołny desktopowy archiw sem "
+"njepasuje</b>Dospołny archiw <b>.magnolie</b> z Magnolie Organizera so z "
+"<i>Import dospołneho archiwa na tutym graće hišće podpěrany njeje.</i> "
+"wotpokaza. Wobchowajće tutón archiw za desktopowy Organizer.</div>"
 
